values ('L1-S1','L1-S1-M1','M1','Why Do We Travel?','Why do people travel?','Understand that travel helps people visit, learn, discover, and explore.','Why Stamp','L1-S1-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M2','M2','My First Suitcase','What should I pack?','Learn how travelers prepare luggage.','My Stamp','L1-S1-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M3','M3','My Travel Ticket','What is a travel ticket?','Recognize that tickets help organize a journey.','My Stamp','L1-S1-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M4','M4','Where Am I Going?','How do I choose a destination?','Understand that every journey has a destination.','Where Stamp','L1-S1-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M5','M5','Travel Documents','What papers help me travel?','Recognize basic travel documents.','Travel Stamp','L1-S1-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M6','M6','Travel Checklist','How do I know I am ready?','Use a simple checklist before travel.','Travel Stamp','L1-S1-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M7','M7','Travel Safety Rules','Why do travel rules matter?','Understand simple safety behavior before a trip.','Travel Stamp','L1-S1-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M8','M8','Who Helps Me Travel?','Who helps travelers?','Recognize people who support a journey.','Who Stamp','L1-S1-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M9','M9','How Long Is My Journey?','How long will travel take?','Understand that journeys can take different lengths of time.','How Stamp','L1-S1-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M10','M10','My Travel Plan','How can I plan my journey?','Put simple travel steps in order.','My Stamp','L1-S1-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M11','M11','Ready To Go!','How do I know I am ready to leave?','Review the main steps before leaving for the airport.','Ready Stamp','L1-S1-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M12','M12','Next Stop: The Airport','What happens when I reach the airport?','Prepare learners for the airport experience.','Next Stamp','L1-S2-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M1','M1','What Is An Airport?','What is an airport?','Recognize an airport as a place where journeys by air begin and end.','What Stamp','L1-S2-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M2','M2','Airport Entrance','Where do travelers enter the airport?','Recognize the airport entrance and arrival area.','Airport Stamp','L1-S2-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M3','M3','Check-In Area','What happens at check-in?','Understand the basic purpose of check-in.','Check Stamp','L1-S2-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M4','M4','Baggage Drop','Where does my suitcase go?','Recognize that checked baggage is accepted and moved separately.','Baggage Stamp','L1-S2-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M5','M5','Security Check','Why do we pass through security?','Understand that security checks help keep travel safe.','Security Stamp','L1-S2-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M6','M6','Passport Control','Why are travel documents checked?','Recognize that travel documents are checked before international travel.','Passport Stamp','L1-S2-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M7','M7','Departure Hall','Where do travelers wait before boarding?','Recognize the departure hall and waiting areas.','Departure Stamp','L1-S2-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M8','M8','Finding My Gate','How do I know where to board?','Use signs and gate information to find the right place.','Finding Stamp','L1-S2-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M9','M9','Airport Signs','How do airport signs help me?','Recognize common airport signs and symbols.','Airport Stamp','L1-S2-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M10','M10','Airport Vehicles','What vehicles work at the airport?','Recognize simple airport service vehicles.','Airport Stamp','L1-S2-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M11','M11','Airport Teamwork','Why do many people work together?','Understand that airports depend on teamwork.','Airport Stamp','L1-S2-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M12','M12','Next Stop: Boarding','What happens before I enter the aircraft?','Prepare learners for the boarding process.','Next Stamp','L1-S3-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M1','M1','What Is Check-In?','Why do passengers check in?','Understand that check-in confirms a passenger''s journey.','What Stamp','L1-S3-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M2','M2','My Boarding Pass','What is a boarding pass?','Recognize the boarding pass as an important travel document.','My Stamp','L1-S3-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M3','M3','Baggage Tag','Why does my suitcase get a tag?','Understand that baggage tags help bags reach the correct destination.','Baggage Stamp','L1-S3-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M4','M4','Airport Security Tray','Why do I use a tray at security?','Recognize basic security screening steps.','Airport Stamp','L1-S3-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M5','M5','Waiting At The Gate','What should I do while waiting?','Understand calm and safe behavior at the gate.','Waiting Stamp','L1-S3-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M6','M6','Boarding Call','How do I know when it is time to board?','Recognize boarding announcements and instructions.','Boarding Stamp','L1-S3-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M7','M7','Boarding Groups','Why do people board in groups?','Understand simple organization during boarding.','Boarding Stamp','L1-S3-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M8','M8','Walking To The Aircraft','How do passengers reach the aircraft?','Recognize different ways passengers move from gate to aircraft.','Walking Stamp','L1-S3-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M9','M9','Aircraft Door','Where do I enter the aircraft?','Recognize the aircraft door and boarding entrance.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S3-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M10','M10','Finding My Seat','How do I find my seat?','Use seat numbers and simple signs to find a seat.','Finding Stamp','L1-S3-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M11','M11','Cabin Welcome','Who welcomes passengers onboard?','Recognize the cabin crew welcome role.','Cabin Stamp','L1-S3-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M12','M12','Next Stop: Meet The Team','Who helps make a flight possible?','Prepare learners to discover aviation roles.','Next Stamp','L1-S4-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M1','M1','Meet The Pilot','What does a pilot do?','Recognize the pilot as the person who flies the aircraft.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M2','M2','Meet The Cabin Crew','What does cabin crew do?','Recognize cabin crew responsibilities for safety and passengers.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M3','M3','Meet The Ground Staff','Who helps passengers at the airport?','Recognize the role of passenger service staff.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M4','M4','Meet The Ramp Team','Who works around the aircraft on the ground?','Recognize basic ramp operations roles.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M5','M5','Meet The Baggage Team','Who moves passenger bags?','Recognize how baggage teams support a flight.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M6','M6','Meet The Engineer','Who checks the aircraft?','Recognize aircraft engineers and maintenance staff.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M7','M7','Meet Air Traffic Control','Who helps aircraft move safely in the sky and airport?','Recognize air traffic control as part of aviation safety.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M8','M8','Meet Airport Security','Who helps protect the airport?','Recognize airport security responsibilities.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M9','M9','Meet The Dispatcher','Who helps prepare the flight?','Recognize the flight dispatcher as part of flight preparation.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M10','M10','Meet The Cargo Team','Who helps move goods by air?','Recognize air cargo staff and their role.','Meet Stamp','L1-S4-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M11','M11','One Big Aviation Team','Why do all aviation roles need each other?','Understand that safe aviation depends on teamwork.','One Stamp','L1-S4-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M12','M12','Next Stop: Inside The Aircraft','What will I discover inside an aircraft?','Prepare learners to explore the aircraft interior.','Next Stamp','L1-S5-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M1','M1','What Is An Aircraft?','What is an aircraft?','Recognize an aircraft as a machine that can fly.','What Stamp','L1-S5-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M2','M2','Aircraft Nose','What is at the front of the aircraft?','Recognize the nose section of an aircraft.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M3','M3','Aircraft Wings','Why does an aircraft have wings?','Recognize wings as an important part of flight.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M4','M4','Aircraft Tail','What is at the back of the aircraft?','Recognize the tail section.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M5','M5','Aircraft Engines','What helps an aircraft move?','Recognize aircraft engines.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M6','M6','Aircraft Wheels','Why does an aircraft need wheels?','Recognize landing gear and ground movement.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M7','M7','Inside The Cabin','What is the passenger cabin?','Recognize the cabin as the area where passengers sit.','Inside Stamp','L1-S5-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M8','M8','Inside The Cockpit','Where do pilots work?','Recognize the cockpit as the pilots'' working area.','Inside Stamp','L1-S5-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M9','M9','My Seat And Seat Belt','Why do I wear a seat belt?','Recognize the seat belt as an important safety item.','My Stamp','L1-S5-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M10','M10','Overhead Bins','Where do small bags go?','Recognize overhead storage areas.','Overhead Stamp','L1-S5-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M11','M11','Aircraft Safety Card','What information is on the safety card?','Recognize the passenger safety card.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M12','M12','Next Stop: My First Flight','What happens when the aircraft starts moving?','Prepare learners for the flight experience.','Next Stamp','L1-S6-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M1','M1','Before Takeoff','What happens before the aircraft takes off?','Recognize simple pre-takeoff steps.','Before Stamp','L1-S6-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M2','M2','Taxiing','Why does the aircraft move on the ground?','Understand that aircraft taxi before takeoff and after landing.','Taxiing Stamp','L1-S6-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M3','M3','Takeoff','What happens during takeoff?','Recognize takeoff as the moment the aircraft leaves the ground.','Takeoff Stamp','L1-S6-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M4','M4','Flying High','What happens when we are in the sky?','Recognize the cruise part of a flight.','Flying Stamp','L1-S6-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M5','M5','Looking Out The Window','What can I see from the aircraft?','Observe the world from above.','Looking Stamp','L1-S6-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M6','M6','Cabin Service','What happens during a flight?','Recognize simple passenger service during flight.','Cabin Stamp','L1-S6-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M7','M7','Turbulence','Why does the aircraft sometimes feel bumpy?','Understand turbulence in a simple, reassuring way.','Turbulence Stamp','L1-S6-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M8','M8','Preparing To Land','What happens before landing?','Recognize simple landing preparation.','Preparing Stamp','L1-S6-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M9','M9','Landing','What happens when the aircraft returns to the ground?','Recognize landing.','Landing Stamp','L1-S6-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M10','M10','Taxi To The Gate','What happens after landing?','Understand that the aircraft taxis to a gate or stand.','Taxi Stamp','L1-S6-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M11','M11','Leaving The Aircraft','What do passengers do after the aircraft stops?','Recognize safe disembarkation.','Leaving Stamp','L1-S6-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S6','L1-S6-M12','M12','Next Stop: Around The World','Where can aviation take us?','Prepare learners for global discovery.','Next Stamp','L1-S7-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M1','M1','Our Big World','How big is the world?','Recognize that aviation connects many places around the world.','Our Stamp','L1-S7-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M2','M2','Egypt','What can I discover in Egypt?','Explore Egypt through simple geography and aviation.','Egypt Stamp','L1-S7-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M3','M3','United Arab Emirates','What can I discover in the UAE?','Explore the UAE through simple geography and aviation.','United Stamp','L1-S7-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M4','M4','France','What can I discover in France?','Explore France through simple geography and aviation.','France Stamp','L1-S7-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M5','M5','United States','What can I discover in the USA?','Explore the USA through simple geography and aviation.','United Stamp','L1-S7-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M6','M6','Japan','What can I discover in Japan?','Explore Japan through simple geography and aviation.','Japan Stamp','L1-S7-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M7','M7','Maps And Routes','How do aircraft travel between places?','Recognize simple routes on a map.','Maps Stamp','L1-S7-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M8','M8','Time Zones','Why is the time different in other places?','Recognize that places can have different local times.','Time Stamp','L1-S7-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M9','M9','Languages Around The World','Do people speak the same language everywhere?','Build awareness of different languages.','Languages Stamp','L1-S7-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M10','M10','Famous Landmarks','What famous places can aviation help us visit?','Recognize simple world landmarks.','Famous Stamp','L1-S7-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M11','M11','My Dream Destination','Where would I like to travel?','Use imagination to choose and describe a destination.','My Stamp','L1-S7-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S7','L1-S7-M12','M12','Next Stop: Weather','How does weather affect our journey?','Prepare learners to explore weather and flying.','Next Stamp','L1-S8-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M1','M1','What Is Weather?','What is weather?','Recognize basic weather conditions.','What Stamp','L1-S8-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M2','M2','Sunny Day','What does sunny weather look like?','Recognize sunny weather.','Sunny Stamp','L1-S8-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M3','M3','Cloudy Sky','What are clouds?','Recognize clouds and cloudy weather.','Cloudy Stamp','L1-S8-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M4','M4','Rainy Weather','What happens when it rains?','Recognize rainy weather.','Rainy Stamp','L1-S8-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M5','M5','Wind','What is wind?','Recognize wind as moving air.','Wind Stamp','L1-S8-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M6','M6','Fog','Why is it sometimes hard to see?','Recognize fog in a simple way.','Fog Stamp','L1-S8-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M7','M7','Storms','What is a storm?','Recognize storms and the importance of safety.','Storms Stamp','L1-S8-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M8','M8','Weather At The Airport','Why do airports watch the weather?','Understand that weather information helps aviation teams.','Weather Stamp','L1-S8-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M9','M9','Weather And Takeoff','Can weather affect takeoff?','Understand that weather can affect flight operations.','Weather Stamp','L1-S8-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S8','L1-S8-M10','M10','Weather And Landing','Can weather affect landing?','Understand that weather can affec