ected?','Review learner progress using the passport concept.','Explorer Stamp','L1-S10-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S10','L1-S10-M10','M10','My Final Aviation Mission','Can I complete one final challenge?','Apply key learning in a final mission.','My Stamp','L1-S10-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S10','L1-S10-M11','M11','Junior Explorer Graduation','What does it mean to complete Level 1?','Celebrate learning and recognize achievement.','Junior Stamp','L1-S10-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S10','L1-S10-M12','M12','Next Level Preview','What will I discover next?','Introduce the next level journey.','Next Stamp','L2-S1-M1','Not Started',12),('L2-S1','L2-S1-M1','M1','Why Travel Plans Matter','Why do people plan before traveling?','Understand how preparation makes travel easier and safer.','Why Stamp','L2-S1-M2','Not Started',1),('L2-S1','L2-S1-M2','M2','Choosing A Destination','How do people choose where to travel?','Compare simple reasons for choosing destinations.','Choosing Stamp','L2-S1-M3','Not Started',2),('L2-S1','L2-S1-M3','M3','Travel Budget Basics','Why do travelers think about money?','Understand that travel planning includes simple budgeting.','Travel Stamp','L2-S1-M4','Not Started',3),('L2-S1','L2-S1-M4','M4','Travel Documents Explained','Why are travel documents important?','Understand the purpose of basic travel documents.','Travel Stamp','L2-S1-M5','Not Started',4),('L2-S1','L2-S1-M5','M5','Packing For The Journey','How do I choose what to pack?','Make simple packing decisions based on a journey.','Packing Stamp','L2-S1-M6','Not Started',5),('L2-S1','L2-S1-M6','M6','Travel Checklist Explained','Why does a checklist help?','Understand how checklists reduce mistakes.','Travel Stamp','L2-S1-M7','Not Started',6),('L2-S1','L2-S1-M7','M7','Journey Time','Why do journeys take different amounts of time?','Compare journey duration and distance.','Journey Stamp','L2-S1-M8','Not Started',7),('L2-S1','L2-S1-M8','M8','Direct And Connecting Flights','What is the difference bet